## 2. دوره‌های آموزشی و درسنامه‌ها (Courses & Lessons)

{% for course in courses -%}
### {{ course.persianTitle | safe }} ({{ course.title | safe }})
- URL: {{ site.url }}{{ course.url | url }}
- Instructor: {{ course.instructorFa | safe }}
- Summary: {{ course.desc | safe }}
- Lessons:
{% for item in collections.all -%}
  {%- if item.url and '/lessons/' in item.url and course.slug in item.url %}
